{
  "longTitle": "A Bill to make provision for the recording and publication of specific expenses incurred by certain public servants; to promote transparency in the use if public funds; and for connected purposes",
  "summary": "<p>This Bill would require board members of public authorities who come under the Freedom of Information Act 2000 to publicise their expenses on travel, accommodation and subsistence, either in the annual report, or in a separate publication.</p>",
